[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9602.87, "timestamp": "02:40:02", "text": "23号门。23号门。24号门在这里。不，不，不，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9604.469, "timestamp": "02:40:04", "text": "不。千万别这么做。那是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9606.23, "timestamp": "02:40:06", "text": "假门。那扇门就是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9608.23, "timestamp": "02:40:08", "text": "会要了你的命。所以，你就像是，我们曾经是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9612.469, "timestamp": "02:40:12", "text": "实际上在22号门，22号房间。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9621.83, "timestamp": "02:40:21", "text": "哦，你好，K，下一个。你好，闪亮勺子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9623.91, "timestamp": "02:40:23", "text": "欢迎光临。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9627.03, "timestamp": "02:40:27", "text": "你好。哦，等等。那是20。哦，是的。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9632.23, "timestamp": "02:40:32", "text": "26岁。呃，24岁。好的。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9642.79, "timestamp": "02:40:42", "text": "还有另一款类似游戏的门，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9644.71, "timestamp": "02:40:44", "text": "但它感觉更像是……更多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9646.389, "timestamp": "02:40:46", "text": "节奏快，而且更像是某种……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9649.19, "timestamp": "02:40:49", "text": "比这更有趣的游戏。这远不止如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9652.03, "timestamp": "02:40:52", "text": "同类"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9654.87, "timestamp": "02:40:54", "text": "有点吓人，因为你得付钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9657.51, "timestamp": "02:40:57", "text": "仔细观察。"}]